@startuml
title Pegawai Mengajukan Dokumen Material

actor "Pegawai" as Pegawai
participant "UI Ajukan Dokumen" as UI
participant "API Dokumen" as API
participant "Auth / RBAC" as Auth
participant "Workflow Service" as Workflow
participant "Attachment Handling" as Attachments
database "Database" as DB

Pegawai -> UI : Isi form dokumen Material
Pegawai -> UI : Tambahkan lampiran
UI -> API : Submit dokumen Material
API -> Auth : Validasi dms_session dan role PEGAWAI

alt session atau role tidak sah
  Auth --> API : Tolak akses
  API --> UI : Unauthorized / Forbidden
else akses sah
  API -> Workflow : Validasi field Material dan kelengkapan
  Workflow -> Workflow : Pastikan nominal_realisasi diisi

  alt field wajib, kelengkapan, atau lampiran tidak valid
    Workflow --> API : Validasi gagal
    API --> UI : Tampilkan error validasi
  else validasi bisnis berhasil
    API -> Attachments : Validasi dan formalisasi lampiran

    alt lampiran gagal diproses
      Attachments --> API : Gagal aman
      API --> UI : Submit gagal tanpa data parsial
    else lampiran siap dicatat
      Attachments --> API : Metadata lampiran aman
      API -> Workflow : Buat dokumen Material
      Workflow -> DB : Simpan dokumen dan nominal_realisasi
      Workflow -> DB : Set status IN_PPK_VALIDATION
      Workflow -> DB : Tambah log aktivitas
      DB --> Workflow : Dokumen tercatat
      Workflow --> API : Dokumen dibuat
      API --> UI : Dokumen berstatus IN_PPK_VALIDATION
    end
  end
end

@enduml
